 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kizokuka Sannan no Nariagari Life - Umarete Sugu ni Jingai Nintei Sareta Shounen wa Isekai wo Mankitsu Suru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "貴族家三男の成り上がりライフ　生まれてすぐに人外認定された少年は異世界を満喫する"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After losing his life in an accident, an ordinary young man finds himself in the afterlife, where he meets the Creator God who rules over another world!? Reborn by the God's power as the third son of a noble family, named Alrain, he is showered with love by his family and grows up healthily. However, even after his reincarnation, numerous deities keep coming to see him one after another. Favored and blessed abundantly by these gods, Alrain eventually realizes he possesses powers far beyond human capabilities.\n\nWanting to live a low-key life, Alrain hides his abilities and enrolls in a magical academy, enjoying a fun school life in this new world. But trouble doesn't leave him alone. Assassins from dark guilds, foolish nobles plotting to overthrow the kingdom, and even demons defying the gods appear, throwing his life into chaos. In the face of such turmoil, he can no longer stay silent! To resolve the kingdom-wide uproar, he unleashes his \"god-class\" powers!",
   "ja": "御山聖夜は「地球の救世主」――となるはずの女子高生を助けて、代わりに命を落とした平凡な青年。死後の世界で出会ったのは、異世界を統べる創造神!?　神の力で貴族の三男アルラインとして転生した彼は、家族たちに溺愛されながら健やかに育っていく。しかし、転生した後も次から次へとやって来る数多の神々。彼らに気に入られ加護てんこ盛りにされたアルラインは、気づけば人の領域を遥かに超えた力を持っていた。やがて彼は、王国全土を揺るがす「大事件」に関わる事になるのだが――？"
  },
